WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: ay

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Suma arunaka, akax Código de Manera satawa.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.350
Software ukax mä complejo ukhamawa

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.890
Nayraqatax walja codigo ukanakaw utji, ukax qillqt’añaw wakisi.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.710
Ukhama uñacht’awi proyectos ukanakax aka serie ukan lurawayta

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.270
Uka códigojj 12.000 jila líneanakaniwa.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.320
Ukaxa chiqapa servicio operativo ukhamawa

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.530
Mä jisk’a servicio ukhamäkchisa, jasakiw 100.000 líneas ukjat jila.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:25.300
Patak waranqa chimpunakax pä tunk novelas phuqhantañatakix wakisiwa.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.560
Jaya codigo qillqañax janiw tukusxi sañ munkiti.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.540
Jumax qillqt’at código ukarux askichaskakiñamawa.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.800
A askichasaxa, B ukaxa p’akjasi.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.130
B ukar askichasax A ukat C ukanakax p’akjatäniwa.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:44.260
Mä analogía apnaqañatakix mä Rasputa ukan katjata ukat jachañjamawa.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.360
Mä caballor uñtasit mä jan waltʼäwiw sasaw sasma.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:50.550
Aka pachanxa, diseño lurañax wakisitap amuyasïta.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.010
Ukampis kunapachatï chiqpachapuni mä documento de diseño qillqañ yantʼäta ukhaxa,

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.490
P’iqiman amuyunakax concretamente uñacht’ayaña

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:01.260
Ukajj janiw kunjamtï amuykta ukham faciläkiti sasaw amuyäta.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:05.600
Partituras, ukax mä documento satawa, ukax uñjkañaw sonido jan ukax musica graba,

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.700
Ukax aka ch’amäxiwa

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.610
Janiw musica ukakikiti, jan ukasti qullqi tuqit ukhamarak logística tuqitwa

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:14.060
Juk’amp kunayman amuyunaka ukat abstracto apnaqirin mayiwinakapa

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:17.220
Mä modelo específico ukan uñacht’ayañax janiw jasakikaniti.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:19.490
Utjrini

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:23.200
Abstracto amuyunaka modelado ukan ch’amätap atipjañataki

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.860
UML ukax 1990 mara tukuyanw yuritayna.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.120
Ukax Grady Butch jupan p’iqinchatawa.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.390
UML ukax suyt’awimpiw apnaqapxta

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.990
Mä clase diagrama uñacht’ayaña

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.760
Ukhamaraki, mä secuencia diagrama uñacht’ayañäni

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:39.980
ukampirus

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.160
Chiqpachansa diseñar yantʼkayäta ukhaxa, directo codificañat sipansa mayjänwa.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.130
Janiw sinti mayjäkaspas ukhamäkiti

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:46.520
¿Kunatsa ukham lurasi?

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.910
Ukax kunatix amuyt’awix phuqhañ yatitawa.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.170
Abstracto amuyunakax juk’amp concreto ukham lurañat sipansa,

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:57.590
Kunatix implementación-nivel amuyt’awinak UML ukar jaqukipi.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.270
Partituranak liytʼañ yatta laykuki

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:01.950
Janiw kunjamtï nayax composirjamäkti

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.850
UML ukan yatiqatamata ukhamakiw

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.170
Janiw kunjamtï jumax diseño lurañ yatiñanak jilxattaykta ukhamäkiti.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.300
Ukhamajj aka serienjja

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.580
Chiqpach proyectos ukanakampi

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.420
Kunjamasa concretizar requisitos abstractos ukaxa

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.290
¿Jumax uka codigo ukarux conectasmati?

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.010
Nayax jumanakar uñjañ munapxsma

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:20.930
Nayax cine boletonak dominio ukarjam reservañ amtawayta

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.200
Películan billetes reservacionanakax jasakiw amuyañaxa kunatix jilpachax dominios uñt’atanakawa.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.710
Kunayman lurawinakaw utji, sañäni, mantañ, payllañ, ukat qunuñanak ajlliña.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.580
Mä suma uñachtʼäwikïkaspas ukhamawa

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.890
Jilpachax aka qillqatan temapax software diseño ukawa, ukampis...

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:40.350
Ukhamarakiw yant’awimp apnaqat lurawinak uñakipt’añäni.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:44.890
Jichha pacha nayrar sartañ pachanakax nativamente yant’äw yänak yanapt’apxi.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.320
Uñt’at proyectos de código abierto ukanakar uñakipt’kasas,

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:51.130
Jiwasax mä nivel de prueba ukaniwa.

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:56.200
Ukajj yantʼanakajj wali wakiskiriwa ukat wali askirakiwa sañwa munaspa.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:58.120
Ukampis cheqpachansa

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.590
Walja kutix janiw TDD ukakikiti, jan ukasti automatización de pruebas ukax janiw sum phuqhaskiti.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:06.260
Nayraqatax jan kuna wakicht’asisaw aski yant’äwinak qillqañaxa

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.540
Janipuniw faciläkiti

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:12.340
Akax mä kunaw software diseño ukan mayacht’at ch’amanchawinakap mayi.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.270
Ukhama, diseño ukat TDD ukanakamp mayacht’asis uñjañax juk’amp askiwa.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.180
Nayajj ukajj wali sumäkaspas ukhamwa amuyayäta

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:23.450
Ukhamajj jichhajj uka proyecton nayrïr tantachäwip qalltañäni.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.470
Kunatix akax mä jisk’a lurawiwa

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.090
Ukanjja, pä jilatanakaw tantachasipjje

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:32.340
Ch’iqa tuqinkir jaqix dominio ukan yatxatatawa, ukatx ch’iqa tuqinx desarrollador ukhamawa.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:37.790
Dominio yatxatirinakax sistemas ukanakan lurañax wakiski ukanakanx mä arsuwiw utji.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.280
Walja sarnaqäwinakatwa parli

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.160
Uka teatro ukax jiwasanakan apnaqatawa

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.710
Markpachanx niya pusi waranq jaqinakaw utji.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:47.220
Inas jutïrin jukʼamp jiljjattaspa.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:50.480
Jichhax, cine boleto reservañ función ukakiw yanapt’ata.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:54.510
Qhipharux jach’a uñacht’äwinakatakiw billetes aljasiñanak yapxatañ amtapxta.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:58.940
Ukat wali wakiskirïki ukajja, janipuniw asientonak doble reservañamäkiti.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:03.250
Nayra pachanx centros de servicio al cliente ukanakax chiqpachans uka kasta jan walt’awimp ch’am tukupxäna.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:07.670
Kunatix walja pelicula yatiyawinakaw utji ukat revisión de datos ukax nayratpach apthapitawa.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:11.090
Uka yatiyawinakax jan mayjt’ataw qhiparañapa.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.730
Aka chiqanx aruskipäwix suma wakicht’atawa, ukampis

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.960
Chiqansa, jukʼamp yatiyawinakaw utji

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.600
Ukax jan wakicht’ataw puriyatäni

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:22.110
Ukampis kuna sarnaqäwitix proyecto qalltawinx mistki ukax ukhamawa

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:23.780
Kunatix ukax juk’amp wakiskir mayiwiwa

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.320
Suma istʼañamawa

