00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.190
Diseño ukhamaraki implementación ukanakana yant’awinaka ukhamaraki pantjasiwi jisk’achaña.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.530
Jichhakamax aruskipt’ataparjama

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.970
Jiwasax aljirinakax apnaqañ tuqitx pusi tuqitw wakicht’apxta:

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.470
Ukxarusti, administrador ukax utjarakiwa

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.850
Administrador ukax uñjaspawa phisqa apnaqañ yänakax utjiwa:

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.620
Naya pachpatakix "Gestión" uka aru apnaqañax desarrollo ukanx wali amuyumpiw uñjta.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.980
Gestión ukax mä expresión sinti jach’awa

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.030
Kuntï lurapkta ukajj janiw qhanäkiti

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.950
Akansa ukhamarakiwa

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.760
¿Kunjamsa chiqpachapuni apnaqasi?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.810
Janiw yatkti

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.620
Dominio yatxatirinakamp aruskipt’asa

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.220
Sapa apnaqañ yänakax mä específico caso de uso ukar jach’anchayatawa.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.660
Ukax chiqpach proyecto ukhamawa

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
Inas ukat sipan juk’amp apnaqañ utanakax utjchispa.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.000
Aka chiqanx qhanañcht’añatakiw ch’amanchawayta.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.700
Kunatix aka chiqanx wali askiw amuyañaxa, kunapachatix mä t’ijtäw pacha lurapk ukhax .

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
Ukhamaraki, uka boleto ukaxa luratarakiwa

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.200
Ukat kunapachatï mä boleto alasktan jan ukajj kuttʼayañäni ukhajja

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:53.910
Ukhamaraki uñjaraksnawa mä anqäxa servicio apnaqapxta, ukaxa payllawi punku satawa.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Nayax aljirinakax ukat irpirinakan casos de uso ukanakap mayachthapiyäta.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Taqi uka apnaqañ tuqit uñakipt’asa

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
Kunas ch’usäkaspas ukhamaw amuyasi

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
Mä teatro yapxatañatakix mä amtawiw utji

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
Nayax janiw kunas Teatro de Busqueda ukar uñtasit uñjkti

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
Ukhamarjamax mä qawqha casos de uso ukanakax jan uñt’ayatäkaspas ukhamawa.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
Kunatix mä yatxatat dominio ukan uñjatapatxa, walja qhanañcht’awinakaw utji.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
Aka apnaqañ caso, ukax wali qhanpach uñt’atawa, .

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
Uka qhanañchäwix janiw sañjamakiti

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
Ukhamajj ¿mä desarrolladoran uñjatapat kamsasmasa?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
Ukax juk’amp askiwa, jan ch’amäki uka yatiyäwinak jaytañaxa, kunjamatix teatro ukar thaqhañaxa.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
¿Janit ukax documentonak apnaqañatakix jukʼamp yanaptʼkaspa?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
Ukax backend diseño ukawa

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Casos de uso simples ukanakax teatro ukar thaqhañjamawa

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Nayax amuyta, ukax walikïskiwa

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
Kuntix nayax siskta ukax janiw sinti qhipäkiti, phuqhañ pachanx jaysañataki.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Ukampis chiqpach proyecto ukhamächi ukhaxa

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
Pantalla planificadores ukanakatakix aka casos de uso ukax mä suma qalltawiwa.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Planificador ukax mä teatro thaqhañatakix caso de uso uñakipäna.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
¿Kunjamsa teatronak thaqhañax wakisispa?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
Jumaw amuytʼasirïta

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Kunawsatix diagramas ukanakax mäkiw mayacht’atäki ukhax ch’amäkaspas ukhamaw uñstaski.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
Chiqpach proyecto ukhamäspa ukhaxa, jukʼamp chʼamäspawa.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
Ukhamächi ukhaxa, janiw mä fusión ukar ch’amanchañax wakiskiti.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Nayax jichhakiw jupanakarux akan mayacht’awayta, chhaqhat casos ukanakax utji uk uñacht’ayañataki.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Taqi uka chhaqhat cajanakaruw phuqhantawayta

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Nayax mä caso de uso ukanx actor ukar conexión ukax apsutawa.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
Ukax aljirinakataki ukhamarak irpirinakatakiw apnaqasi.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
Ukat jan ch’amäñapatakix inglés arut qillqt’awayta.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Jichhax walikïskiwa kunatix mä jisk’a proyecto ukhamawa

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Uka proyectox jach’a ukat complejo ukhamawa

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
¿Kawkhans mä dominio yatxatirix qhanañchañ qalltañapa?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
Inas chʼamächispa

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
¿Kunsa mä administrador luraspa?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
Ukax walja irnaqawiwa

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Kunjamtï irpirit suyatäki ukhama

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
Ukhamächi ukhaxa, ¿actoranakax subdividirsnati?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
Ukhamaraki, uñakipt’añax wali askiwa

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
Qalltanjja, administrador sasaw sapjjetäna

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
Inas lurañanakjam jaljañax wakischispa

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
Ukat Sistema de Reserva de Películas uka apnaqasa

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
Inas anqäx markan servicios ukanakax utjchispa

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
Jiwasatix actoranakax ukham segmentarañäni ukhaxa,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
Dominio ukan yatxatirinakax juk’amp sistematico yatiyawinak churañ yatipxani.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
Chiqansa, akax mä uñacht’äwikiwa, mä complejo dominio uñakipañataki.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Inas yaqha suma thakhinakax utjchispa

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
Kuna jan walt’awis utji ukarjamaw jan mayjt’ir jaysañax wali aski.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Ukaw tukuyañataki

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
Jichha kutix mä diagrama de caso de uso ukampiw apnaqañäni

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
Uka proyecto lurañatakejj amtanakam wakichtʼasim

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Nayax qallta etapas de análisis ukaruw sarawayta.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
Naya pachpatakixa, taqpacha nayraru sartawi lurawi taypina

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Nayax amuyta análisis ukax juk’amp ch’amawa

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
Kunatix juk’amp abstracto ukat vago amuyunakax wakicht’añasawa.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Jutïr kutix jach’a apnaqañ tuqit uñakipt’añäni

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
Uka tuqit jukʼamp sum amuytʼañäni

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Jichhakamax wali ch’amampi irnaqapxatamat yuspajarapxsma.

